{
  "id": "asoxRecvN8nStart",
  "name": "recv-n8n-start",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## recv-n8n-start (alert queue set-up and crash recovery, N8N-1.4)\n**Trigger:** n8n itself: instance started, or this workflow published or updated (import, `bootstrap.sh core`).\n**Inputs:** none (lib-config `alert_queue`).\n**Actions taken:** creates the Data Tables `asox_alert_queue` and `asox_queue_slots` if missing (idempotent: \"reuse existing\"); keeps exactly `alert_queue.slots` slot rows; deletes `done` rows older than `keep_done_h`. **Only when the instance started:** frees the slots and requeues the `running` rows that the stopped process left (claimed more than `restart_grace_s` before this start; a restart takes longer), or marks them `failed` and parks them (lib-error, with the Wazuh alert id) after `max_attempts`. Every change is a compare-and-set on the row's `claim`.\n**Systems changed:** n8n's own Data Tables only.\n**Approval:** not applicable.\n**Owner:** n8n.\nSaved: every run (a few per restart or import).",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "b4dfa8d2-5171-5f44-9dee-45edcac20ee6",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -420
      ]
    },
